{"identity":{"original_title":"Maze Creep!!","developers":["Bosskiller Studios"],"publishers":["Bosskiller Studios"],"release_status":"released","release_date":"2026-05-13","tags":["恐怖","幽默","在线合作","程序生成","生存恐怖"]},"hooks":[{"text":"敌人不掌握玩家位置，只能靠视听搜寻；Maze Creep甚至能跨任意距离听见奔跑、跳跃和说话","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"Most enemies are entirely organic, wandering the maze with zero knowledge of where players are, forced to find you through sight and sound. Maze Creep can hear you sprint, jump, even speak, from any distance. Many other enemies can utilize hearing as well. Utilize stealth and speak softly to evade detection.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4014040/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"多数敌人无法正面消灭，多个威胁需结合道具、机智与环境共同破解","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"The game has a focus on stealth over confrontation against most enemies that create joint threats with one another that must be solved using your items, wits, and the environment.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4014040/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"以讽刺方式把恐怖类型套路夸张到荒谬极限","dimension":"题材","excerpt":"Maze Creep!! is a stealth-focused satire of the horror genre, unafraid to exaggerate horror tropes to their most ridiculous extremes.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4014040/","label":"证据原文片段"}],"opinions":[],"metrics":[{"id":"sales","label":"销量","value":570,"unit":"份","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"wishlist","label":"愿望单","value":5084,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"followers","label":"关注人数","value":155,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"revenue","label":"收入估算","value":3177,"unit":"USD","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"players","label":"玩家数","value":710,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"owners","label":"拥有者估算","value":710,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"playtime","label":"平均游玩时长","value":7.539978364366191,"unit":"小时","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"reviews","l